{
    "title": "PDF Reader: PDF Viewer",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf89 Congratulations on discovering <b>the most comprehensive and easy-to-use</b>PDF Reader App!\r\n\r\nUnlock top-notch features to effortlessly <b>read, edit, split, merge, create, and convert your PDF files</b> within this intuitive PDF Reader: PDF Viewer.\r\n\r\nMeet all your <b>personalized reading needs</b> with comprehensive support for <b>annotation, doodling, commenting, inserting pictures, adding text</b>, and more.\r\n\r\nSimplify your PDF management tasks by quickly <b>sharing, printing, splitting, merging, and converting</b> PDF files.\r\n\r\nPlus, with the added convenience of <b>signing your PDF files anytime, anywhere</b>, directly from your phone, you're all set for seamless document handling <b>on the go</b>.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Ready to dive deep into our features? \r\nOr give it a try now! \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcda <b>Read PDFs with customized modes tailored to your preferences!</b>\r\n\u2714 Go-to-Page: Continuous reading or jumping into the pages you want.\r\n\u2714 TXT Mode: Easily adjust the font size for comfortable PDF reading.\r\n\u2714 Dark Mode: Eye-friendly, especially for late-night PDF reading.\r\n\u2714 PDF Rotation: Rotate PDFs effortlessly for optimal viewing orientation.\r\n\u2714 Search: Feel free to search for words, short phrases, or sentences as you wish!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcdd <b>Edit PDFs with comprehensive tools to enhance your work or study needs.</b>\r\n\u2714Annotation: Highlight, underline, copy, and strikethrough PDFs effortlessly with just a tap.\r\n\u2714Doodle: Bring your creativity to life within your PDFs.\r\n\u2714Insert Images & Text: Expand your editing and commenting capabilities in PDFs.\r\n\u2714E-Sign/Add e-Signature: Securely store multiple e-signatures for yourself and your family, simplifying PDF signing for all. Instantly transform them into legally binding documents with a simple click.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f <b> Seamlessly Split, Merge, and Convert your PDF easily.</b>\r\n\u2714 Split: Effortlessly remove or extract pages from your PDFs, offering maximum flexibility and ease of use.\r\n\u2714Merge: Seamlessly combine multiple PDFs or insert additional pages as needed, all in one convenient process.\r\n\u2714Image to PDFs: Convert images to PDFs quickly and efficiently, simplifying your document management tasks.\r\n\u2714Scan to PDFs: Enhance clarity and sharpness in scans with cropping and auto-enhancing.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1 <b> A glimpse into more PDF management features.</b>\r\n\u2714Search PDFs\r\n\u2714Share PDFs\r\n\u2714Print PDFs\r\n\u2714Re-Name PDFs\r\n\u2714Add Password to PDFs\r\n\u2714Bookmark PDFs\r\n\u2714Locate Recently PDFs\r\n\u2714Delete PDFs\r\n\r\nWait, there's more for you! \u2728\r\n\r\n<b>Not just PDFs, but also support for Docs, Excels, PPTs, TXTs \u2013 your office tools on the go!</b>\r\n\u2714<b>Open and Read Docs, Excels, PPTs, TXTs</b>\r\n\u2714Search Docs, Excels, PPTs, TXTs\r\n\u2714Share Docs, Excels, PPTs, TXTs \r\n\u2714Re-Name Docs, Excels, PPTs, TXTs\r\n\u2714Bookmark Docs, Excels, PPTs, TXTs\r\n\u2714Locate Recently Docs, Excels, PPTs, TXTs \r\n\u2714Delete Docs, Excels, PPTs, TXTs\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Embark on a journey of effortless PDF management \u2013 open and experience the power of our PDF reader: PDF Viewer today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udf89 Congratulations on discovering <b>the most comprehensive and easy-to-use</b>PDF Reader App!<br><br>Unlock top-notch features to effortlessly <b>read, edit, split, merge, create, and convert your PDF files</b> within this intuitive PDF Reader: PDF Viewer.<br><br>Meet all your <b>personalized reading needs</b> with comprehensive support for <b>annotation, doodling, commenting, inserting pictures, adding text</b>, and more.<br><br>Simplify your PDF management tasks by quickly <b>sharing, printing, splitting, merging, and converting</b> PDF files.<br><br>Plus, with the added convenience of <b>signing your PDF files anytime, anywhere</b>, directly from your phone, you&#39;re all set for seamless document handling <b>on the go</b>.<br><br>\ud83d\ude80 Ready to dive deep into our features? <br>Or give it a try now! <br><br>\ud83d\udcda <b>Read PDFs with customized modes tailored to your preferences!</b><br>\u2714 Go-to-Page: Continuous reading or jumping into the pages you want.<br>\u2714 TXT Mode: Easily adjust the font size for comfortable PDF reading.<br>\u2714 Dark Mode: Eye-friendly, especially for late-night PDF reading.<br>\u2714 PDF Rotation: Rotate PDFs effortlessly for optimal viewing orientation.<br>\u2714 Search: Feel free to search for words, short phrases, or sentences as you wish!<br><br>\ud83d\udcdd <b>Edit PDFs with comprehensive tools to enhance your work or study needs.</b><br>\u2714Annotation: Highlight, underline, copy, and strikethrough PDFs effortlessly with just a tap.<br>\u2714Doodle: Bring your creativity to life within your PDFs.<br>\u2714Insert Images &amp; Text: Expand your editing and commenting capabilities in PDFs.<br>\u2714E-Sign/Add e-Signature: Securely store multiple e-signatures for yourself and your family, simplifying PDF signing for all. Instantly transform them into legally binding documents with a simple click.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f <b> Seamlessly Split, Merge, and Convert your PDF easily.</b><br>\u2714 Split: Effortlessly remove or extract pages from your PDFs, offering maximum flexibility and ease of use.<br>\u2714Merge: Seamlessly combine multiple PDFs or insert additional pages as needed, all in one convenient process.<br>\u2714Image to PDFs: Convert images to PDFs quickly and efficiently, simplifying your document management tasks.<br>\u2714Scan to PDFs: Enhance clarity and sharpness in scans with cropping and auto-enhancing.<br><br>\ud83d\udca1 <b> A glimpse into more PDF management features.</b><br>\u2714Search PDFs<br>\u2714Share PDFs<br>\u2714Print PDFs<br>\u2714Re-Name PDFs<br>\u2714Add Password to PDFs<br>\u2714Bookmark PDFs<br>\u2714Locate Recently PDFs<br>\u2714Delete PDFs<br><br>Wait, there&#39;s more for you! \u2728<br><br><b>Not just PDFs, but also support for Docs, Excels, PPTs, TXTs \u2013 your office tools on the go!</b><br>\u2714<b>Open and Read Docs, Excels, PPTs, TXTs</b><br>\u2714Search Docs, Excels, PPTs, TXTs<br>\u2714Share Docs, Excels, PPTs, TXTs <br>\u2714Re-Name Docs, Excels, PPTs, TXTs<br>\u2714Bookmark Docs, Excels, PPTs, TXTs<br>\u2714Locate Recently Docs, Excels, PPTs, TXTs <br>\u2714Delete Docs, Excels, PPTs, TXTs<br><br>\ud83d\ude80 Embark on a journey of effortless PDF management \u2013 open and experience the power of our PDF reader: PDF Viewer today!",
